WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:19.362
delivered the huevos rancheros to the woman and then ducked into the kitchen, trying not to panic.

2
00:00:23.463 --> 00:00:25.724
But the customer had seen her levitation ability!

3
00:00:32.492 --> 00:00:35.253
And now the woman was typing rapidly into her comm device!

4
00:00:35.273 --> 00:00:39.896
"What if she's one of those alien hunters?"

5
00:00:40.296 --> 00:00:40.816
Ally thought.

6
00:00:40.836 --> 00:00:45.379
"She might try to trap me and put me in the Sandville UFO Museum!"

7
00:00:46.559 --> 00:00:50.401
Ally peeked out, watching the woman as she took a few bites of food and then put her

8
00:00:50.421 --> 00:00:50.921
fork down.

9
00:00:52.282 --> 00:00:56.124
She typed some more, casting her eyes all around the diner every once in a while.

10
00:01:00.028 --> 00:01:13.654
Ally was trying to read the woman's mind when a couple entered the Ally sighed and went out

11
00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:14.154
to greet them.

12
00:01:18.416 --> 00:01:19.696
you have room for us?"

13
00:01:20.197 --> 00:01:20.877
the woman asked.

14
00:01:21.877 --> 00:01:24.078
Ally gestured around the nearly empty diner.

15
00:01:24.098 --> 00:01:25.679
"We sure do."

16
00:01:25.699 --> 00:01:28.200
"Great!" the man said.

17
00:01:28.652 --> 00:01:29.833
"There are 12 of us."

18
00:01:30.613 --> 00:01:31.794
Ally's eyes went wide.

19
00:01:32.314 --> 00:01:38.058
"Twelve?" "We went to Pepe's first, but they said it would be a long wait."

20
00:01:38.078 --> 00:01:44.762
"Oh! Well, sit wherever you like, and I'll be right back to take your orders."

21
00:01:46.863 --> 00:01:48.144
Ally scurried to the office.

22
00:01:48.164 --> 00:01:50.726
"Ray!" she squealed.

23
00:01:50.746 --> 00:01:54.088
"Twelve people just walked in!"

24
00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:02.804
When she returned to the dining room with water for the new customers, they were chattering away to

25
00:02:02.884 --> 00:02:03.324
one another.

26
00:02:04.906 --> 00:02:13.633
lecture on extraterrestrial life-forms the foremost authority on other galaxies "No one knows more about the study of

27
00:02:13.773 --> 00:02:19.959
aliens "They're talking about that alien expert," Ally realized.

28
00:02:20.839 --> 00:02:21.720
Her heart sank.

29
00:02:22.821 --> 00:02:24.983
These customers must be alien hunters too!

30
00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:31.621
Then to Ally's horror, the woman in the leopard-print dress stood up and approached some people in the

31
00:02:31.661 --> 00:02:36.523
group. Ally dashed back into the kitchen.

32
00:02:36.543 --> 00:02:40.984
"She's telling them she saw me levitate that plate!"

33
00:02:41.524 --> 00:02:41.984
Ally thought.

34
00:02:42.004 --> 00:02:43.165
"Oh no.

35
00:02:43.705 --> 00:02:44.765
What if they tell Dr.

36
00:02:44.825 --> 00:02:45.725
Lloyd about me?"

37
00:02:46.826 --> 00:02:49.326
She closed her eyes for a second, thinking about running away.

38
00:02:50.046 --> 00:02:52.887
But then her eyes landed on Ray, who was heating up a grill.

39
00:02:54.288 --> 00:02:56.684
"I can't abandon Ray," she thought.

40
00:02:56.704 --> 00:02:59.726
"And an Astralian never gives up.

41
00:03:00.347 --> 00:03:04.009
If the woman tells people she thinks I'm an alien, I'll just deny it!

42
00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.011
Ray will defend me!"

43
00:03:10.654 --> 00:03:14.677
When Ally went to take the new customers' orders, the woman in the leopard-print dress was gone.

44
00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:20.781
Ally took a deep breath.

45
00:03:20.801 --> 00:03:24.543
"What would you like?"

46
00:03:24.903 --> 00:03:25.404
she asked.

47
00:03:26.068 --> 00:03:29.430
"I'll have huevos rancheros," the first diner said.

48
00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:30.911
"Me too!"

49
00:03:30.931 --> 00:03:32.952
"Me three!"

50
00:03:32.972 --> 00:03:38.895
"We all want huevos rancheros," the first diner said.

51
00:03:38.915 --> 00:03:41.597
"Everyone?" Ally asked.

52
00:03:42.917 --> 00:03:44.418
"Yes!" the man went on.

53
00:03:44.438 --> 00:03:47.940
"Another customer was raving about them.

54
00:03:48.621 --> 00:03:50.642
She told us they couldn't be missed."

55
00:03:50.662 --> 00:03:53.643
"Is that all the woman was telling them?"

56
00:03:54.024 --> 00:03:54.504
Ally thought.

57
00:03:55.112 --> 00:03:55.893
"I hope so."

58
00:03:55.913 --> 00:04:00.637
"Twelve orders of huevos rancheros coming right up!"

59
00:04:01.918 --> 00:04:02.919
She rushed to the kitchen.

60
00:04:08.624 --> 00:04:12.987
Exactly one hour later, 12 satisfied customers filed out of the diner.

61
00:04:14.689 --> 00:04:16.751
None of them seemed to suspect a thing about Ally.

62
00:04:17.131 --> 00:04:20.053
And they all promised to come back with their friends and families soon.

63
00:04:21.815 --> 00:04:22.936
Ally blew out a breath.

64
00:04:25.468 --> 00:04:32.251
"If even half of them come back," she murmured, "and bring about two people with them, and then

65
00:04:32.311 --> 00:04:38.013
those two people return and bring two more, that's—" "Oh good!"

66
00:04:38.653 --> 00:04:40.074
Mateo rushed into the diner.

67
00:04:40.094 --> 00:04:42.955
"She's not here yet."

68
00:04:42.975 --> 00:04:44.996
"Who?" Ally asked.

69
00:04:45.016 --> 00:04:49.098
"It's no big deal," Mateo tried to sound casual.

70
00:04:49.118 --> 00:04:53.660
"Bethany's going to swing by to hang out."

71
00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.202
"Swing by to hang out?"

72
00:04:59.103 --> 00:05:00.424
Ally gazed up at the ceiling.

73
00:05:02.546 --> 00:05:04.888
Were they going to hang from the light fixtures or something?

74
00:05:04.908 --> 00:05:09.932
"Yeah, you know, to talk and have a bite to eat."

75
00:05:09.952 --> 00:05:13.835
"Oh!" Ally exclaimed.

76
00:05:15.096 --> 00:05:15.817
She shook her head.

77
00:05:16.598 --> 00:05:19.140
She would never get used to the weird things humans said.

78
00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:23.964
"And I have you to thank for it, Ally," Mateo went on.

79
00:05:25.056 --> 00:05:30.279
"If you hadn't said what you said, I'd never have gotten up the nerve to text Bethany."

80
00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.780
Ally tossed her hair proudly.

81
00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.682
"I like to do good deeds."

82
00:05:38.363 --> 00:05:42.726
By the time Bethany and Kate arrived, Ally felt herself relaxing—just a little.

83
00:05:43.887 --> 00:05:48.169
The customer in the leopard-print dress had just been telling the other customers about Ray's good food.

84
00:05:49.089 --> 00:05:49.630
That was all.

85
00:05:51.271 --> 00:05:54.888
"You've got nothing to worry about," she told herself firmly.

86
00:05:54.908 --> 00:05:57.449
"Except new parts and fuel."

87
00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.290
A second later a mother and daughter entered.

88
00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:06.432
"Two muffins to go, please," the mother said.

89
00:06:07.532 --> 00:06:10.653
As Ally handed the muffins to the woman, the little girl peered at her.

90
00:06:15.935 --> 00:06:18.856
Mommy! It's that alien from the park!"
